{"page":34,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:216","surah":2,"ayah":216,"ar_uthmani":"كُتِبَ عَلَيْكُمُ ٱلْقِتَالُ وَهُوَ كُرْهٌ لَّكُمْ ۖ وَعَسَىٰٓ أَن تَكْرَهُوا۟ شَيْـًٔا وَهُوَ خَيْرٌ لَّكُمْ ۖ وَعَسَىٰٓ أَن تُحِبُّوا۟ شَيْـًٔا وَهُوَ شَرٌّ لَّكُمْ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يَعْلَمُ وَأَنتُمْ لَا تَعْلَمُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Fighting is ordained for you, though you dislike it. You may dislike something although it is good for you, or like something although it is bad for you: God knows and you do not.’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كُتِبَ","en_gloss":"Is prescribed","transliteration":"kutiba","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَلَيْكُمُ","en_gloss":"upon you","transliteration":"ʿalaykumu","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلْقِتَالُ","en_gloss":"[the] fighting","transliteration":"l-qitālu","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"while it","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":5,"ar":"كُرْهٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) hateful","transliteration":"kur'hun","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":6,"ar":"لَّكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"to you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":7,"ar":"وَعَسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"But perhaps","transliteration":"waʿasā","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":9,"ar":"تَكْرَهُوا۟","en_gloss":"you dislike","transliteration":"takrahū","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":10,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","en_gloss":"a thing","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and it","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":12,"ar":"خَيْرٌۭ","en_gloss":"(is) good","transliteration":"khayrun","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":13,"ar":"لَّكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":14,"ar":"وَعَسَىٰٓ","en_gloss":"and perhaps","transliteration":"waʿasā","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":15,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"[that]","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":16,"ar":"تُحِبُّوا۟","en_gloss":"you love","transliteration":"tuḥibbū","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":17,"ar":"شَيْـًۭٔا","en_gloss":"a thing","transliteration":"shayan","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":18,"ar":"وَهُوَ","en_gloss":"and it","transliteration":"wahuwa","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":19,"ar":"شَرٌّۭ","en_gloss":"(is) bad","transliteration":"sharrun","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":20,"ar":"لَّكُمْ ۗ","en_gloss":"for you","transliteration":"lakum","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":21,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":22,"ar":"يَعْلَمُ","en_gloss":"knows","transliteration":"yaʿlamu","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":23,"ar":"وَأَنتُمْ","en_gloss":"while you","transliteration":"wa-antum","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":24,"ar":"لَا","en_gloss":"(do) not","transliteration":"lā","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":25,"ar":"تَعْلَمُونَ","en_gloss":"know","transliteration":"taʿlamūna","verse_key":"2:216"},{"pos":26,"ar":"٢١٦","en_gloss":"(216)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:216"}]},{"verse_key":"2:217","surah":2,"ayah":217,"ar_uthmani":"يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ عَنِ ٱلشَّهْرِ ٱلْحَرَامِ قِتَالٍ فِيهِ ۖ قُلْ قِتَالٌ فِيهِ كَبِيرٌ ۖ وَصَدٌّ عَن سَبِيلِ ٱللَّهِ وَكُفْرٌۢ بِهِۦ وَٱلْمَسْجِدِ ٱلْحَرَامِ وَإِخْرَاجُ أَهْلِهِۦ مِنْهُ أَكْبَرُ عِندَ ٱللَّهِ ۚ وَٱلْفِتْنَةُ أَكْبَرُ مِنَ ٱلْقَتْلِ ۗ وَلَا يَزَالُونَ يُقَـٰتِلُونَكُمْ حَتَّىٰ يَرُدُّوكُمْ عَن دِينِكُمْ إِنِ ٱسْتَطَـٰعُوا۟ ۚ وَمَن يَرْتَدِدْ مِنكُمْ عَن دِينِهِۦ فَيَمُتْ وَهُوَ كَافِرٌ فَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ حَبِطَتْ أَعْمَـٰلُهُمْ فِى ٱلدُّنْيَا وَٱلْـَٔاخِرَةِ ۖ وَأُو۟لَـٰٓئِكَ أَصْحَـٰبُ ٱلنَّارِ ۖ هُمْ فِيهَا خَـٰلِدُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"They ask you [Prophet] about fighting in the prohibited month. Say, ‘Fighting in that month is a great offence, but to bar others from God’s path, to disbelieve in Him, prevent access to the Sacred Mosque, and expel its people, are still greater offences in God’s eyes: persecution is worse than killing.’ They will not stop fighting you [believers] until they make you revoke your faith, if they can. If any of you revoke your faith and die as disbelievers, your deeds will come to nothing in this world and the Hereafter, and you will be inhabitants of the Fire, there to remain.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"يَسْـَٔلُونَكَ","en_gloss":"They ask you","transliteration":"yasalūnaka","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":2,"ar":"عَنِ","en_gloss":"about","transliteration":"ʿani","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":3,"ar":"ٱلشَّهْرِ","en_gloss":"the month","transliteration":"l-shahri","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَرَامِ","en_gloss":"[the] sacred ","transliteration":"l-ḥarāmi","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":5,"ar":"قِتَالٍۢ","en_gloss":"(concerning) fighting","transliteration":"qitālin","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":6,"ar":"فِيهِ ۖ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قُلْ","en_gloss":"Say","transliteration":"qul","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":8,"ar":"قِتَالٌۭ","en_gloss":"Fighting","transliteration":"qitālun","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":9,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"therein","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":10,"ar":"كَبِيرٌۭ ۖ","en_gloss":"(is) a great (sin)","transliteration":"kabīrun","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":11,"ar":"وَصَدٌّ","en_gloss":"but hindering (people)","transliteration":"waṣaddun","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":12,"ar":"عَن","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"ʿan","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":13,"ar":"سَبِيلِ","en_gloss":"(the) way","transliteration":"sabīli","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَكُفْرٌۢ","en_gloss":"and disbelief","transliteration":"wakuf'run","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":16,"ar":"بِهِۦ","en_gloss":"in Him","transliteration":"bihi","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":17,"ar":"وَٱلْمَسْجِدِ","en_gloss":"and (preventing access to) Al-Masjid","transliteration":"wal-masjidi","verse_key":"2:217"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱلْحَرَامِ","en_gloss":"Al-Haraam","transliteration":"l-ḥarāmi","verse_key":"2:217"},{"po